#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3285
msgid ""
"A table in PostScript file format can be created starting from the file "
"generated by <application>Gnumeric</application>. The command <_:screen-1/> "
"creates an <keycap>ascii</keycap> (straight text) file. This file will look "
"like: <_:screen-2/>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan skapa en PostScript-tabell från filen som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har skapat. Kommandot <_:screen-1/> "
"skapar en <keycap>ascii</keycap>-fil med vanlig text. Resultatet ser ut så "
"här: <_:screen-2/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3380
msgid "Xbase File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet Xbase"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3382
msgid ""
"The Xbase file format is a file format that includes a series of files of "
"which one is a text file containing the data and the rest are index or other"
" files. The data file consists of a header and then the records themselves."
msgstr ""
"Xbase är ett filformat som består av flera filer. En av dem är en textfil "
"med data, medan de andra innehåller index eller annan information. Datafilen"
" består av ett huvud följt av posterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3389
msgid "<application>Gnumeric</application> only opens the data file."
msgstr "<application>Gnumeric</application> öppnar endast datafilen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3400
msgid "XBase data file format"
msgstr "Datafilformatet XBase"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3412
msgid ""
"<application>dBase</application>, <application>Clipper</application>, "
"<application>FoxPro</application>, <application>Visual dBase</application>, "
"<application>Visual FoxPro</application>, and numerous other database "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Kalkylprogrammen <application>dBase</application>, "
"<application>Clipper</application>, <application>FoxPro</application>, "
"<application>Visual dBase</application>, <application>Visual "
"FoxPro</application> och flera andra databasprogram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3449
msgid "Supported by the 'XBase' plugin."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’XBase’."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3460
msgid ""
"The xBase file format is a generic name for database files saved in the "
"format used by Aston-Tate's (then Borland's) "
"<application>dBase</application> database system. The system became widely "
"popular and has been used extensively by other systems."
msgstr ""
"Filformatet xBase är ett generiskt namn för databasfiler som sparas i "
"formatet från databasprogrammet <application>dBase</application> av Aston-"
"Tate, senare Borland. Formatet blev populärt och har använts i stor "
"utsträckning av andra system."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3468
msgid ""
"See the <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.clicketyclick.dk/databases/xbase/format\"> Xbase File "
"Format Description</ulink> by Erik Bachmann for more details on the xBase "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Mer information om xBase-formatet finns i Erik Bachmanns <ulink "
"type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.clicketyclick.dk/databases/xbase/format\">beskrivning av "
"Xbase-filformatet</ulink>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3493
msgid "XHTML File Format"
msgstr "XHTML-filformatet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3495
msgid ""
"The XHTML file format is a text file format with markup in the eXtensible "
"Markup Language (XML) using a definition which mimics the Hypertext Markup "
"Language (HTML). These files are designed to be viewed in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"XHTML är ett textbaserat filformat med märkning i Extensible Markup Language"
" (XML) och en definition som efterliknar Hypertext Markup Language (HTML). "
"Filerna är avsedda att visas i en webbläsare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3502
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can save the cell contents from a "
"worksheet to a text file which consists of an XHTML file fragment containing"
" only a &lt;table&gt; structure, designed to be inserted into another XHTML "
"file."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan spara cellinnehållet från ett "
"kalkylblad som ett XHTML-fragment med endast en &lt;table&gt;-struktur, "
"avsett att infogas i en annan XHTML-fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3532
msgid ""
"Most modern web browsers such as <application>Mozilla</application> and "
"<application>Mozilla-Firefox</application>"
msgstr ""
"De flesta moderna webbläsare, till exempel "
"<application>Mozilla</application> och <application>Mozilla-"
"Firefox</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3575
msgid ""
"The file is generated, encoded in UTF-8, in the World Wide Web consortium "
"(W3C) XHTML 1.0 Transitional file format."
msgstr ""
"Filen skapas i formatet World Wide Web Consortiums (W3C) XHTML 1.0 "
"Transitional och kodas i UTF-8."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3587
msgid ""
"These XHTML files can be opened by any text editor and can be viewed using "
"any web browser such as <application>Mozilla</application>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan öppna XHTML-filerna i valfri textredigerare och visa dem i en "
"webbläsare, till exempel <application>Mozilla</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3597
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"italic\">See Also:</emphasis> <link linkend=\"file-format-"
"html\">HTML Format</link>"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"italic\">Se även:</emphasis> <link linkend=\"file-format-"
"html\">HTML-format</link>"
